{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["African Americans are more likely to suffer from hypertension (high blood pressure) than European Americans. Why?","Enslaved individuals were transported from Africa in the holds of ships, and given very little water. Those whose bodies conserved salt were more likely to survive the journey. Salt exacerbates high blood pressure."],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"science-technology\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
